# Line endings are a checkout policy, not content. Source-mutation oracles and parity suites
# compare file text against literals written with LF, so a CRLF checkout under core.autocrlf
# would make them report a phantom drift. Normalize on commit and check out LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows command scripts need CRLF to run under cmd.exe.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
